{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02509","headline":"咏笛 · 刘孝孙","name":"咏笛","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"凉秋夜笛鸣，流风韵九成。\n调高时慷慨，曲变或凄清。\n征客怀离绪，邻人思旧情。\n幸以知音顾，千载有奇声。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘孝孙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02509.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02509","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}